  "details": "Simple as this, if we are going to have an 18+ verification system, especially one that costs money, why not add an option to set a created world as only accessible and visible to those with 18+ verification?\n\nPeople are going to create NSFW worlds, that is inevitable, at least this way it provides a way to make it much harder for those who shouldn't be in those worlds to access them.\n\nIt provides more reasons for people to actually get 18+ verified.\n\nLess worlds will need to be deleted as only those who dont set the permissions properly will really be an issue.\n\nAnd in the end it would make things safer, as rather than there being a bunch of NSFW worlds accessible to literally anyone, these worlds will have a healthier outlet, locked safely behind a 18+ barrier.\n\nIt would make people who play VRC happier overall, those who want to see NSFW worlds will be able to, and those who dont, or shouldn't, won't. \n\nTLDR, people are going to create NSFW worlds regardless, at least this way they have a safer and healthier outlet.",
